---
title: "Digital Marketing Insights for Singapore Businesses | Tensionless Digital"
description: "Plain answers to the questions businesses ask before hiring for Google Ads, Facebook ads, SEO and landing pages, from a Singapore digital marketing agency."
permalink: /insights/
layout: false
---
{% extends "sub-page.njk" %}
{% block main %}
<section class="sp-hero">
  <p class="mono kicker">Insights</p>
  <h1>Plain answers, <em>no tension.</em></h1>
  <p class="lede">The questions businesses ask us before they hire anyone for ads, pages or search, answered in full.</p>
</section>
<section class="sp-block" aria-labelledby="list-h">
  <h2 id="list-h" class="sr-only">Articles</h2>
  <ul class="rel rel-hub">
    {%- for post in collections.insight | reverse %}{% if post.url != page.url %}
    <li><a href="{{ post.url }}"><span>{{ post.data.h1 }}</span><span class="rel-lede">{{ post.data.lede }}</span><span class="mono"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></span></a></li>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% endblock %}
